OL,3,AEthiopia and Eritrea accuse each other
OL,4,Aof starting conflict after troops cross
OL,5,Aborder
OL,6,
OL,7,FEthiopia has accused Eritrea of an
OL,8,F"all-out invasion" of its northern
OL,9,FTigray region and warned it will defend
OL,10,Fitself, days after residents told the
OL,11,FBBC Eritrean troops had crossed into
OL,12,Fthe country.
OL,14,FIn a letter to the UN Security Council,
OL,15,FEthiopia's foreign minister called it a
OL,16,F"blatant act of aggression that engages
OL,17,FEthiopia's inherent right to
OL,18,Fself-defence", following reported
OL,19,Fstrikes on Eritrean troops in Tigray.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
