OL,3,AEthiopia and Eritrea accuse each other
OL,4,Aof starting conflict after troops cross
OL,5,Aborder
OL,6,
OL,7,FEritrean Information Minister Yemane
OL,8,FGebremeskel responded by saying it was
OL,9,Ffacing "an unprovoked war of
OL,10,Faggression" from its neighbour.
OL,12,FFighting broke out between the
OL,13,Fgovernment and the party that controls
OL,14,FTigray, the Tigray People's Liberation
OL,15,FFront (TPLF), two weeks ago.
